WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:03.236
NARRATOR: After surviving
a box jellyfish attack,

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:06.706
Dr. Yanagihara recovers at home.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.641
The process is slow and painful.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:13.780
After three days of brutal
agony and a week total,

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.982
there was no sustained relief.

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:19.853
My skin became
terribly inflamed all

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.755
along these different tracks.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:24.090
Around my neck was
like rope burns.

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:28.161
I tried the topical steroids
and some other things.

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:29.162
And nothing worked.

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:30.463
Nothing worked.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:36.069
I felt really curious
what happened to me.

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:37.971
Why did it hurt so bad?

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:39.572
What's the physiology of this?

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:42.242
What's the biochemistry
of the venom?

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:47.480
OK, you box jellyfish, you
brought the [inaudible] to me.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:53.887
So now let me see
what makes this tick.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:55.188
NARRATOR: Following
the incident,

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:57.424
Dr. Yanagihara
dedicates her life

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.226
to studying the creature
that nearly killed her,

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.995
making breakthrough
discoveries that

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:04.831
are crucial to public safety.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:09.502
There's not many researchers
in this particular species.

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:14.941
Angel has done amazing work and
established that the jellyfish

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:16.509
moves with the lunar cycle.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:20.413
Every month, 8 to 10
days after the full moon,

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:25.251
along Waikiki, these animals
would show up like clockwork,

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:29.656
exactly on the lunar calendar,
purposefully triggered

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:33.393
in the predawn hours to spawn.

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:36.329
NARRATOR: Her research not only
helps prevent jellyfish stings

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:39.265
but has led to the creation of
a topical treatment currently

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:42.735
used by the US Navy
special ops teams.

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:45.171
And for anyone who gets
stung by a jellyfish,

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:47.173
the remedy is simple.

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:50.643
The best first
aid is two steps.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.413
First, flood the sting
site with vinegar

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:56.749
to inactivate these
little capsules so

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:58.351
that they can no longer fire.

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:01.521
And that keeps things
from getting worse.

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:07.560
Second, apply heat, 45 minutes
of 42 to 45 degrees Celsius,

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:10.463
which is basically
112 to 115 Fahrenheit

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:14.534
will irreversibly inhibit the
venom and change the course.

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:19.305
And now your body can repair
itself and you can recover.

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:22.308
One of the things that
concerns me is when folks want

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:26.246
to think of jellyfish
as nuisances or sinister

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:28.381
or they're out to get me.

00:02:28.448 --> 00:02:30.783
I was crossing paths with
something that's been

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:33.052
going on for 600 million years.

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:35.955
Looking back on all
that I know now,

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:40.126
I understand that I was in the
wrong place at the wrong time.

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:43.630
When I entered the water,
I was entering their world.

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.532
And I crossed their path.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:49.802
So that was not their
fault, but mine.

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:53.106
[music playing]

